@host = http://localhost:5241

### Neighbourhoods with listing counts (for the location picker)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/neighbourhoods

### Everything, cheapest first (first page)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search

### Location by neighbourhood
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search?neighbourhood=La%20Jolla

### Location by map area + all filters (Mission Bay)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search?minLat=32.74&maxLat=32.80&minLon=-117.27&maxLon=-117.20&minPrice=100&maxPrice=300&roomType=Entire%20home/apt&guests=4&stay=short

### Monthly stays, most expensive first, second page
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search?stay=long&sort=priceDesc&page=2&pageSize=10

### Validation error: incomplete map area -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search?minLat=32.74&maxLat=32.80

### Validation error: minPrice > maxPrice -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/listings/search?minPrice=500&maxPrice=100
